            "review_title": "Review at Xoi ba Hong",
            "review_text": "Authentik Vietnam\nHanoi, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nThe best sticky rice restaurant in the old town\nDec 2023 • Friends\nOne of the best sticky rice restaurants in Hanoi that I have eaten. Sweet and fragrant sticky rice like yellow flower sticky rice. Delicious sticky rice eaten with toppings of braised meat, pate, rolls, and eggs is also very delicious. Why does white sticky rice go so well with this food?\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten January 8, 2024",
